@startuml
title UC-02 - Register Resource Type
autonumber
actor "Platform Engineer" as PE
boundary ResourceTypeController as API
control ResourceTypeService as Service
entity ResourceType as Validator
database ResourceTypeRepository as Repo

PE -> API: RegisterResourceType(document) [MS-01]
API -> Service: RegisterResourceType(ctx, command)
Service -> Validator: Validate() [MS-02]
Validator --> Service: valid
Service -> Repo: ListResourceTypes(orgID) [MS-03]
Repo --> Service: no duplicate key
Service -> Repo: CreateResourceType(orgID, resourceType) <<transaction>> [MS-04]
note right of Repo
Insert-only: database uniqueness is final guard.
Concurrent duplicate cannot replace a contract.
end note
Repo --> Service: ResourceType
Service --> API: ResourceType [MS-05..MS-06]
API --> PE: Registered
@enduml
